 both died and it becomes apparent that  their daughter l is the missing key to  project aries jacob's mercenary seem to  have only been waiting for this moment  as they storm the hideout and free ellen  her boss while roman and tatch are  supposed to destroy a crucial satellite  in space another encounter between  dumb's crew and jacob reveals that the  lattice partner otto is actually working  for the cyber terrorist cipher  eventually jacob decides to side with  his brother and with some luck taj and  roman succeed in destroying this  satellite before the upload of project  aries is completed in the end there is a  happy ending after all and jacob is able  to escape with the help of dom and his  car besides during the credits you can  see han who was presumed dead it's not  that easy to make guesses regarding the  plot of fast and furious 10 after all is  neither official information about the  story nor a first trailer the  interesting aspect of the film series  however is that just about anything is  possible as we saw in the ninth part not  even outer space is left out as an  action-packed setting so how does the  fast and furious team plan to go the  extra mile maybe they don't even have to  as the focus has always been on the  family like dumb never ceases to point  out it is therefore quite possible that  they will slowly but surely hand over  the reins to the next generation in  parts 10 and 11. at least mia actress  jodena brewster has already suggested  something similar in the past we also  know from an instagram video of vin  diesel from may 30th that they want to  return to the roots of the franchise  diesel and his colleague tyrese gibson  can be seen standing in the fabled  garage of the first part but does this  really mean that we will see more petty  crime car racing and less mission  impossible like action again in fact  it's doubtful after all a return to the  roots could simply mean the toretto  family's roots which recently gained  another family member in the form of  grandma toretto taking distance from the  over-the-top action in the final stages  does not sound like fast and furious at  all another important story aspect is of  course the villains that show up it is  considered likely that charlize theron  cipher will once again serve as the  antagonist particularly after her  elaborate plan failed again the  terrorists will surely have a bone to  pick with dominus crew apart from cypher  we firmly anticipate the return of  daggett shaw from fast and furious 7  since his comeback was already hinted at  in the mid-credits scene of the last  part this is where jason momoa could  also come into play because this still  unknown character of the 42nd year old  is supposed to be an extremely  extravagant and eye-catching villain  according to his own statement due to  the huge popularity of the aquaman star  he will no doubt end up being the  ultimate bad guy if you look at the  previous movies the villains actually  became nastier more cunning and  increasingly dangerous momoa being the  leader of the pack is therefore the only  logical conclusion although he certainly  will not be the only one to take on dom  and his friends  next we would like to give you a brief  overview of the gigantic cast we know  for sure that vin diesel will be back as  dom toretto michelle rodriguez has his  wife letty ludacris as tash parker  terry's gibson as roman jodena  brewster's dumb sister mia toretto and  nathalie emmanuel as ramsay other cast  members include song kang as han liu  scotties would ask little nobody michael  rooker as buddy cardi b as lisa and  charlie's theron as cipher also recently  announced was the signing of 90 year old  hollywood legend rita moreno asked  granny toretto in still unknown roles  there are jason momoa as well as the  suicide squad star daniela melkeorg  captain marvel actress perry larsen and  reacher actor alan richson there's  already talk of brie larson in  particular as the 32 year old is rumored  to be taking on the role of the missing  sister of brian or connor who was played  by paul walker up until his death either  way it is considered likely that walker  will be given a proper tribute perhaps  the most controversial character  meanwhile is dwayne johnson's luke hopps  at the end of last year vin diesel  desperately tried to convince johnson  via instagram to come back in order for  him to fulfill his destiny diesel also  dragged his children into it as well as  the late paul walker which johnson did  not appreciate at all the latter  confirmed in an interview with the cnn  that he considered diesel's attempt to  be highly manipulative and there will be  zero chance of him returning to the film  series although vin diesel has tried  everything to persuade johnson it seems  that the conflict between the two rather  stubborn actors was still too profound  nevertheless we can certainly look  forward to more luke hopscott and in the  future  since the spin-off hops in shaw is not a  part of the main series and many people  are expecting a further spin-off in the  future according to media reports the  most recent edition is us comedian pete  davidson so far so good however he drew  attention in 2015 by making a crude joke  about paul walker's accidental death  behind the scenes this is now causing  resentment as many of the actors  involved first expect a public apology  before working with a 28 year old  however there may also have been some  sort of internal deal as davidson is not  exactly known for justifying his jokes  which is a tricky subject for a comedian  anyway  filming of fast and furious 10 began  last april starting in london the  production is taking place back to back  by the way which means that the last  part fast and furious 11 is being shot  at the same time soon after filming  began director justin lin quit  reportedly due to differences regarding  the creative side of things many  speculate that vin diesel might have 